() Tj T*
(Scroll with the mouse wheel, the arrow keys, Page Up and Page Down, or the) Tj T*
(thin scrollbar on the right. Type a page number into the page box in the) Tj T*
(toolbar to jump straight to it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Zoom with Ctrl and the mouse wheel; the point under the pointer stays where it) Tj T*
(is. Ctrl+0 fits the page width, Ctrl+2 fits the whole page, and Ctrl+1 shows) Tj T*
(the page at its real size. In fit-page mode, Page Down moves exactly one page.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Press F11 for full screen. The toolbar and sidebar step aside, and a small) Tj T*
(label shows the page number as you read. Esc brings everything back.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When you close a document, Feather PDF remembers the page, zoom and fit mode,) Tj T*
(and opens it there next time.) Tj T*
ET
