(Press Ctrl+F to open the search field in the toolbar. Enter jumps to the next) Tj T*
(match and Shift+Enter to the previous one. Every match on screen is marked in) Tj T*
(yellow, and the current one in orange.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Long documents are searched in short slices, so the window keeps responding) Tj T*
(while the search runs through hundreds of pages.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Drag across text to select it, double-click to select a word, or press Ctrl+A) Tj T*
(to select the whole page. Ctrl+C copies the selection. Words that were) Tj T*
(hyphenated across a line break are joined again when copied.) Tj T*
ET
