11 0 obj
<< /Length 790 >>
stream
0.06 0.46 0.43 rg 72 744 468 3 re f 0 g
BT /F2 22 Tf 72 700 Td (3. How it stays light) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 17 TL 72 668 Td
() Tj T*
(Only the pages on screen are rendered, at screen resolution. Rendered pages) Tj T*
(are kept in a cache with a fixed budget of 32 MB; the least recently used ones) Tj T*
(are dropped first, and the cache is emptied when the window is minimized.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(At high zoom, only the visible part of a page is rendered, so a page shown at) Tj T*
(800 percent does not need a bitmap hundreds of megabytes large.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The file itself is read on demand instead of being loaded into memory, and when) Tj T*
(the PDF engine builds up too much internal data from pages it has visited, the) Tj T*
(document is quietly reopened to release it.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
